✅ Q5 — Find Average of Numbers

🎗️ 5.1 Problem Statement

You are given a List<Integer> containing positive, negative, and zero values.
Using Java Streams, calculate the average of all numbers.

Your solution should:

👉 Use the Stream API.
🔴 Return the average correctly as a decimal value.
🔴 Correctly handle positive and negative numbers.
🔴 Correctly handle an empty list.
🔴 Avoid accidentally performing integer division.

🎗️ 5.2 Input / Output

👉 Input List<Integer> v = List.of(10, 20, 30, 40, 50);
👉 Expected Output : 30.0

🎗️ 5.3 Your Task

Write the Java Stream solution.
You can provide:

🔴 Your primary Stream approach.
🔴 Any alternative Stream-based approaches only.
🔴 Empty-list handling.
🔴 Time and space complexity, if you want to attempt them.
